# UED Design System Rules

This is a UED design project. All UI changes must follow these conventions:

## Colors
- Use theme variables from `src/theme.tsx` (e.g., `theme.t_fff`, `theme.bg_white_05`, `theme.buy`, `theme.sell`)
- Never hardcode hex colors
- Alpha variants: `theme.t_fff_80` (80% opacity white)

## Components
- Import UI components from `src/UI` only, never from `@mantine/core`
- Use named buttons: `PrimaryBtn`, `GhostBtn`, `BuyBtn`, `SellBtn`, `MiniBtn`
- Use `PillTabs` for tab navigation
- Use `BottomModal` for business modals

## Styling
- Use `styled-components` with theme injection
- Type theme as `ThemeType` from `src/theme`
- Styled components at bottom of file, prefixed with `Styled`

## Scope
- Only modify files in: `src/UI/`, `src/theme.tsx`, `src/style/`, `src/components/*/views/`
- Never modify: `src/state/`, `src/mock/`, `src/utils/`, `src/providers/`
- All API data comes from mock — never write real API calls

## Fonts
- `theme.fontRegular` / `theme.fontMedium` / `theme.fontBold`
